# AH-186: every text file checks out LF on every PC. Left unspecified, core.autocrlf=true (Windows, GitHub's Windows
# runners) wrote CRLF, and tools/test_site.mjs read none of contact.yml's field ids (mutations.json the same day, AH-189)
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe runs install.bat line by line and needs CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
# the Chaos Dataset is scored byte for byte, its CRLF included (test_chaos_dataset.py)
docs/airlock/chaos_dataset.csv -text
# an invite kit (relay/new-invite.mjs) is git archive HEAD: install.bat and the engine read nothing in these
/.claude export-ignore
/docs export-ignore
